The other checks pass. The schema has 49 columns, the weights sum to 8,577,199, and `respondent_id` is unique in the output. Those checks don't test whether all the duplicates were found. Deduplicating on `respondent_id` alone probably missed the re-interviews. The "all checks green" report is therefore misleading.

